Package: netpulse
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: network activity tray monitor for V\OS
 NetPulse is a small Deskbar tray item showing current network
 activity (input/output rate) for the selected interface, with a
 statistics window and interface switching from the context menu.
